  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Drafting Implementation Plans**\n\nI\'m now drafting the `implementation_plan.md` artifact, using `write_to_file`. I\'m focusing on the required sections: a project/feature name header and user information.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6051740"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Comprehensive implementation plan for BossVsLeader Android app with SQLite persistence, Jetpack Compose M3 UI, animated top navigation, quiz mode, and rich micro-learning lessons.\",\"UserFacing\":true},\"CodeContent\":\"# BossVsLeader Android Application\\n\\nBossVsLeader is a modern micro-learning application built with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and Material 3, designed to teach leadership excellence by contrasting Boss behaviors (command, control, blame) with Leader behaviors (inspire, coach, take responsibility).\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The user confirmed the following preferences in Phase 1:\\n- **Visual Accent Theme**: Dynamic Boss Red (#D32F2F) and Leader Blue (#0288D1) gradient aesthetic with polished M3 surfaces.\\n- **Initial Screen**: Home dashboard featuring greeting, streak flame counter, progress ring, and \\\"Lesson of the Day\\\".\\n- **Quiz Structure**: Relaxed self-paced learning mode with instant explanations and immediate feedback.\\n\\n- **Confirmed Decision 1**: SQLite persistence via custom `DatabaseHelper` (SQLiteOpenHelper) running on `Dispatchers.IO`, pre-seeded with 20 rich lessons and 30 quiz questions on first launch.\\n- **Confirmed Decision 2**: Signature 3-second animated splash screen with spring-animated crown and fading whistle icons, leading directly to the Home dashboard.\\n- **Confirmed Decision 3**: Custom animated top navigation bar with collapsing scroll behavior, shifting gradient background, and animated tab indicator pill.\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Does**: Teaches users effective leadership principles through interactive lessons, side-by-side behavioral comparisons, self-paced quizzes, bookmarking, and streak/progress tracking.\\n- **Target Audience**: Aspiring managers, team leads, professionals, and anyone looking to transition from traditional boss mentalities to inspiring leadership.\\n- **Key Value**: Engaging micro-learning architecture with immediate practical takeaways, offline SQLite storage, and gorgeous M3 animations.\\n\\n## 2. User Experience & Visual Design\\n\\n- **Key User Flows**:\\n  1. **Splash Screen**: 3-second branded animation with progress bar -> Home dashboard.\\n  2. **Home Dashboard**: Daily greeting, streak counter with pulse, progress ring, lesson of the day, quick category access.\\n  3. **Lessons Catalog & Detail**: Categorized lazy column with read times and completion checkmarks; detail view with side-by-side Boss (red panel) vs Leader (blue panel) breakdown, scenarios, key takeaways, and bookmarking.\\n  4. **Compare Mode**: Swipeable horizontal pager of \\\"Boss says vs Leader says\\\" flip cards.\\n  5. **Quiz Mode**: Self-paced questions with instant feedback, explanations, score tallying, and persistent history saved to SQLite.\\n  6. **Profile & Stats**: Comprehensive learning analytics, bookmarks list, dark/light theme toggle, and progress reset option.\\n- **Visual Identity & Theme**:\\n  - *Aesthetic Direction*: Polished, premium micro-learning experience with warm Boss red accents, cool Leader blue/teal highlights, and deep charcoal/slate surfaces.\\n  - *Color Palette & Mood*: Material 3 ColorScheme with custom dynamic gradient headers (`rememberInfiniteTransition`), soft tonal elevation, and glassmorphic card overlays.\\n  - *Typography & Hierarchy*: Clean Material 3 typography scale utilizing `sp` units for fluid accessibility scaling.\\n\\n## 3. Key Product Decisions & Trade-Offs\\n\\n- **Decision 1: SQLite via SQLiteOpenHelper vs Room**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Raw SQLite with explicit DAO-style repository wrapper and coroutines (`Dispatchers.IO`).\\n  - *Why*: Matches exact prompt requirements, avoids heavy annotation processors while providing robust, reliable local offline storage.\\n- **Decision 2: Custom Animated Top Navigation Bar**\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Custom collapsible app bar with animated gradient background, sliding tab indicator pill, and cross-fading destination titles.\\n  - *Why*: Delivers the high-end polished experience specified in the app concept without generic template constraints.\\n\\n## 4. Technical Architecture & Data Strategy\\n\\n```\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                        UI Layer                        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  (Jetpack Compose, M3 Theme, Screens: Home, Lessons,   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202   LessonDetail, Compare, Quiz, Profile, Splash)        \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                           \342\224\202 StateFlow / Actions\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220\\n\342\224\202                      ViewModel Layer                   \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202         (MainViewModel handling app state & events)    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\254\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230\\n                           \342\224\202 Coroutines (Dispatchers.IO)\\n\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\226\274\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200